t accelerating my own card depletion. The landlord has only 2 cards; if I play too aggressively, I might end up helping them win by passing later when I could have blocked. Playing ♦5 keeps pressure on the teammate to contribute while conserving high cards (like ♣2 and the jacks) for关键时刻 (critical moments) where I can stop the landlord.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♦5"]}'}
